DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wirqed.cn,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tktjpm.cn,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ediayikma.cc,PROXY

# --- 2048ai / 麻豆AI ---
